1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,191
This contract-review workspace was built from one request.

2
00:00:04,232 --> 00:00:09,240
Users can upload contracts, follow review progress and download reports.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:17,970
Ask Penguin Harness for a legal agent that identifies risky clauses, suggests revisions and provides a working interface.

4
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:21,081
Upload a sample contract.

5
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:26,226
The agent reads it and runs the review in the background, while the page shows progress.

6
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:32,497
The report cites clauses, explains business risks and suggests alternative wording.

7
00:00:32,539 --> 00:00:35,648
Read it here or download it for legal review.

8
00:00:36,617 --> 00:00:43,891
The company requires written acceptance before payment, limits client-data reuse and flags one-sided liability caps.

9
00:00:43,933 --> 00:00:46,633
Save these requirements to memory.

10
00:00:47,575 --> 00:00:55,165
In a new session, the agent reads those saved requirements and applies them to the payment, data-use and liability clauses.

11
00:00:56,033 --> 00:01:00,086
Add status counts, company branding and report previews.

12
00:01:00,128 --> 00:01:03,670
Here, we switch the workspace to a card layout.

13
00:01:04,617 --> 00:01:07,504
Saving changes reloads the application.

14
00:01:07,546 --> 00:01:13,226
Existing review records remain available, so users do not need to upload their files again.

15
00:01:14,158 --> 00:01:18,945
When the agent misses a risk, add that contract as an evaluation case.

16
00:01:18,986 --> 00:01:22,804
The optimizer can revise the review method and retest.

17
00:01:23,783 --> 00:01:28,654
In the separate decision-agent demo, scores improve from eighty-four to one hundred.

18
00:01:28,695 --> 00:01:32,670
That cycle costs about fifteen cents in model calls.

19
00:01:33,617 --> 00:01:39,172
These five sample reviews cost about four cents in total: under one cent each on average.

20
00:01:39,214 --> 00:01:42,070
Application creation is excluded.

21
00:01:43,033 --> 00:01:47,207
Our goal is the most comprehensive agent self-evolution platform.

22
00:01:47,248 --> 00:01:50,886
Download the app or explore the source at these addresses.
